name 'thinking-critically-about-ai-postassessment-q3_2026-pilot'

question 'A student creates a set of user guidelines for their class AI tool. Which guideline reflects the MOST sophisticated understanding of responsible AI use?'

wrong '"Always run your prompt through a spell-checker before submitting it to the AI."'
wrong '"Never use AI for creative projects because it replaces human imagination."'
wrong '"Trust AI outputs that include specific numbers and statistics, since those are harder to make up."'
right '"Treat AI outputs as a starting point for your own thinking — verify claims, check for bias, and make the final decision yourself."'

allow_multiple_attempts true

